Code List EU - European e-Invoice Code Lists

Copyright 2025-2026 Svante Schubert

This product includes software developed by members of the European e-Invoice
Technical Advisory Group.

This project downloads and organizes European EN16931 code lists and supporting
artefacts, including:
- Electronic Address Schemes (EAS)
- VAT Exemption Reason Codes (VATEX)
- Validation artefacts for UBL and CII syntaxes
- Genericodes for cross-border transactions
- Technical guidance documents

This is an unofficial showcase. The authoritative code lists and supporting
artefacts are those the European Commission publishes in its Registry of
supporting artefacts to implement EN16931:
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/sites/spaces/DIGITAL/pages/467108974/Registry+of+supporting+artefacts+to+implement+EN16931

